The container image is based on Alpine Linux and therefore also contains
packages such as musl (MIT), busybox (GPL-2.0-only), apk-tools (GPL-2.0-only)
and alpine-baselayout. These are independent programs aggregated in the image;
they are not linked into the Howlite Resources binary. Corresponding sources
for all Alpine packages are published at https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports
and via https://pkgs.alpinelinux.org.

A machine-generated inventory of every apk package in this image and its
license is available inside the image at:

    /thirdparty-licenses/native/APK_PACKAGE_LICENSES.txt

